D + 5 supplementary `D-*` KILLED,\n164|  shared control SURVIVED), 40/40 termbind rows as expected;\n165|  one raw log per plant in the tarball (285 tmuxserver logs +\n166|  verbose termbind log). 4 new tmuxserver narrowing rows this\n167|  round, 2 reclassified, 2 converted.\n168|- No-real-tmux: zero real-tmux witnesses by the determinism\n169|  design (bound B1); the suite passes with the tmux binary\n170|  unresolvable (1012 passing test events, zero failures, zero\n171|  skips in the changed packages; no tmux process before, during,\n172|  or after).\n173|- Handovers retained: exec/probe adapters driven (unchanged);\n174|  B18 sun_path, B16 ambient, B19/B20 custody, and the P3-A\n175|  fresh-decoy attestation witnesses all still pass; this leaf\n176|  extends the landed termbind owner for successor minting and\n177|  composes terminalbackend, terminstance, axpane, and fencing\n178|  without forking (no landed production file touched this\n179|  round).\n180|\n181|## Validation (all exit 0, this run)\n182|\n183|| Gate | Result |\n184||---|---|\n185|| `go test ./... -count=1` candidate / base | 45 ok / 45 ok, 0 FAILs either tree |\n186|| `go test -race` tmuxserver + termbind | ok, no races |\n187|| `go test ./... -cover` | ok (tmuxserver 88.6%, termbind 83.5%) |\n188|| `go vet ./...` + `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` | clean |\n189|| `gofmt -l` | clean |\n190|| tmuxserver harness 285 + termbind harness 40 | all as expected |\n191|| no-tmux PATH run (changed packages) | green, zero skips, tmux unresolvable |\n192|| closure grid determinism | 6/6 identical streams |\n193|| census recount + matrix mirror check | counts match; tables/bounds byte-identical |\n194|| full configured suite (30 commands) | green firsthand (race gate 419s) |\n195|\n196|Composition: outcome grid over the 36-package closure, 198\n197|shared `(package, entry, input)` keys, MOVED 0, base-only 0,\n198|candidate-only 7 (the declared `CheckSocketLength` × 2 and\n199|`ClassifyStatus` × 5 story-added en