2221\" {\\n',\n2805|        count=1,\n2806|        run=\"(TestAttachRefusesAfterQuiescenceWhenAdmittedLate|TestAttachQuiesceOrderingOverlapQuiesce)\",\n2807|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n2808|        note=\"Admits exactly the fixture instance past the authoritative barrier recheck (a post-quiescence attach commits its receipt); every other instance still revalidates. Kill path: the late attach succeeds with a writable receipt through the attach dispatch.\",\n2809|    ),\n2810|    Mutant(\n2811|        name=\"N-attach-postlock-generation\",\n2812|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/ops.go\",\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
