{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000def1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c930-3251-7961-8bb5-544ec0b1a36c"},"sequence":3539,"recorded_at":1780531400007073,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"54c40bac-01d0-401d-8b14-649734ac40cf","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"54c40bac-01d0-401d-8b14-649734ac40cf","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"54c40bac-01d0-401d-8b14-649734ac40cf"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c953-c45c-7f11-bd50-9b4f984ec6bd"},"task_id":"01a0c953-c45c-7f11-bd50-9b4f984ec6bd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c953-c45c-7f11-bd50-9b4f984ec6bd","chunk":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(264 line(s) above)\n265|## Gate × entry census\n266|\n267|Every gate in the package against every production entry that could\n268|reach it. Columns: AFG = Acquire foreground, ABG = Acquire\n269|background, ENS = EnsureRuntimeDir, VER = VerifyRuntimeDir, ARG =\n270|BuildArgv, SOCK = SocketPath, RES = ResolveSocket, OBS =\n271|ObserveAmbient, BRO = CheckBrokerContact, SRV = CheckServerAttested,\n272|CRE = checkCreationAllowed called directly. Each cell states exactly\n273|one of: M (measured — a named committed test drives the gate through\n274|that entry and a shipped admitting narrowing row kills through that\n275|test; multi-entry rows list every entry their killers cover, verified\n276|per entry from the raw logs), U1 (entry takes no input this gate\n277|decides over), U2 (entry never reaches this code, with the structural\n278|reason), U3 (shadowed — an upstream arm refuses every such input\n279|through this entry first), B (stated bound with the reason). 50 of\n280|264 cells measured, 4 bounds, 210 unreachable with reasons; every\n281|reachable non-bound cell is measured (50 of 54).\n282|\n283|| Gate (site) | AFG | ABG | ENS | VER | ARG | SOCK | RES | OBS | BRO | SRV | CRE |\n284||---|---|---|---|---|---|--